  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_q: 'Can sidewalls be customized separately from the canopy?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls can be sized and printed to match your frame series and campaign. Separate replenishment is common; keep hook placements and zipper lines consistent by referencing the original BOM. Use": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_q: 'Can sidewalls be personalizzato separatamente dal canopy?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_a_html: 'Sì—sidewalls possono essere dimensionati e stampati per abbinare la tua serie di frame e campagna. Rifornimento separato è comune; mantenere posizionamenti gancio e linee di cerniera coerente facendo riferimento al BOM originale.",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_q: 'What sizes are available for custom canopy tents?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_a_html: 'We supply common commercial footprints including 3×3 m, 3×4.5 m, and 3×6 m styles among others. Exact availability depends on frame series—use": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_q: 'Quali dimensioni sono disponibili per tende a baldacchino personalizzate?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_a_html: 'Forniamo impronte commerciali comuni tra cui 3×3 m, 3×4,5 m, e 3×6 m stili tra gli altri. La disponibilità esatta dipende dalla serie frame—uso",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_q: 'Do you offer aluminum and steel frames?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_a_html: 'Yes. Aluminum suits frequent transport; steel can reduce unit cost for budget-led programs. Specify intended use when contacting us so we recommend the right": ".', atterraggio_canopy_buyers_faq_3_q: 'Provate telai in alluminio e acciaio?', atterraggio_canopy_buyers_faq_3_a_html: 'Sì. Alluminio si adatta al trasporto frequente; l'acciaio può ridurre il costo unitario per i programmi a guida di bilancio. Specificare l'uso previsto quando ci contatti quindi consigliamo il diritto",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_q: 'Can sidewalls and accessories be included?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls, weights, and related hardware can be quoted with your frame. Mention venue requirements (e.g., fire retardancy) when requesting": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_q: 'Can sidewalls and accessori be included?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls, weights, and related hardware can be quotad with your frame.",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_h2: 'Custom Canopy Tents — Frequently Asked Questions', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_intro_html: 'Quick answers for buyers; full detail in our": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_h2: 'Custom Canopy Tents — Domande frequenti', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_intro_html: 'Risposte rapide per gli acquirenti; dettaglio completo nel nostro",
  ".', landing_canopy_specs_3_h3: 'Canopy printing', landing_canopy_specs_3_html: 'Dye-sublimation or suitable fabric printing for vibrant logos on": ".', landing_canopy_specs_3_h3: 'Canopy print', landing_canopy_specs_3_html: 'Dye-sublimation o la stampa di tessuto adatta per loghi vibranti su",
  ".', landing_canopy_specs_4_h3: 'Sidewalls & accessories', landing_canopy_specs_4_html: 'Optional sidewalls, half walls, rail skirts, and hardware-compatible weights—list add-ons in your RFQ for a single BOM.', landing_canopy_specs_5_h3: 'MOQ & lead time', landing_canopy_specs_5_html: 'Varies by print complexity and season; review": ".', landing_canopy_specs_4_h3: 'Sidewalls & Accessories', landing_canopy_specs_4_html: 'Optional sidewalls, half walls, rail gonne, and hardware-compatibile pesi—list add-ons in your RFQ for a single BOM.', landing_canopy_specs_5_h3: 'MOQ & lead time' landing_canopy_specs_5_html: 'Vari per complessità e stagione di stampa; recensione",
  ".', landing_canopy_type_3_h3: '3×6 custom canopy tents', landing_canopy_type_3_html: 'High-visibility footprints for sponsor lanes and outdoor retail—ideal when you need maximum graphic area on a single frame. See real-scene examples in the gallery above and": ".', landing_canopy_type_3_h3: '3×6 tende a baldacchino personalizzate', landing_canopy_type_3_html: 'Ingombri ad alta visibilità per le corsie di sponsor e il retail all'aperto—ideale quando hai bisogno di una superficie grafica massima su un unico frame.",
